From onemda@gmail.com  Sat Sep  5 20:18:28 2015  Sat Sep  5 20:18:28 2015
From: onemda@gmail.com (Paul B Mahol) (Paul B Mahol)
Date: Sat,  5 Sep 2015 18:18:28 +0000
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter: add extrastereo filter
Message-ID: <1441477108-12635-1-git-send-email-onemda@gmail.com>

Signed-off-by: Paul B Mahol <onemda at gmail.com>
---
 doc/filters.texi             |  15 ++++++
 libavfilter/Makefile         |   1 +
 libavfilter/af_extrastereo.c | 122 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libavfilter/allfilters.c     |   1 +
 4 files changed, 139 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavfilter/af_extrastereo.c

diff --git a/doc/filters.texi b/doc/filters.texi
index d506d68..e430700 100644
--- a/doc/filters.texi
+++ b/doc/filters.texi
@@ -1817,6 +1817,21 @@ equalizer=f=1000:width_type=q:width=1:g=2,equalizer=f=100:width_type=q:width=2:g
 @end example
 @end itemize
 
+ at section extrastereo
+
+Linearly increases the difference between left and right channels which
+adds some sort of "live" effect to playback.
+
+The filter accepts the following option:
+
+ at table @option
+ at item m
+Sets the difference coefficient (default: 2.5). 0.0 means mono sound
+(average of both channels), with 1.0 sound will be unchanged, with
+-1.0 left and right channels will be swapped.
+ at end table
+
+
 @section flanger
 Apply a flanging effect to the audio.
 
diff --git a/libavfilter/Makefile b/libavfilter/Makefile
index a2af794..e40b83d 100644
--- a/libavfilter/Makefile
+++ b/libavfilter/Makefile
@@ -73,6 +73,7 @@ OBJS-$(CONFIG_DYNAUDNORM_FILTER)             += af_dynaudnorm.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_EARWAX_FILTER)                 += af_earwax.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_EBUR128_FILTER)                += f_ebur128.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_EQUALIZER_FILTER)              += af_biquads.o
+OBJS-$(CONFIG_EXTRASTEREO_FILTER)            += af_extrastereo.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_FLANGER_FILTER)                += af_flanger.o generate_wave_table.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_HIGHPASS_FILTER)               += af_biquads.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_JOIN_FILTER)                   += af_join.o
diff --git a/libavfilter/af_extrastereo.c b/libavfilter/af_extrastereo.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..560f00e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/libavfilter/af_extrastereo.c
@@ -0,0 +1,122 @@
+/*
+ * This file is part of FFmpeg.
+ *
