From ahu@nvidia.com  Fri Sep 11 11:31:30 2015  Fri Sep 11 11:31:30 2015
From: ahu@nvidia.com (Agatha Hu) (Agatha Hu)
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2015 17:31:30 +0800
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 1/3] change cuda ctx creation flag
Message-ID: <1441963890-9284-1-git-send-email-ahu@nvidia.com>

From: agathah <ahu at nvidia.com>

---
 libavcodec/nvenc.c |    2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libavcodec/nvenc.c b/libavcodec/nvenc.c
index 5490652..3174b01 100644
--- a/libavcodec/nvenc.c
+++ b/libavcodec/nvenc.c
@@ -580,7 +580,7 @@ static av_cold int nvenc_encode_init(AVCodecContext *avctx)
     }
 
     ctx->cu_context = NULL;
-    cu_res = dl_fn->cu_ctx_create(&ctx->cu_context, 0, dl_fn->nvenc_devices[ctx->gpu]);
