From onemda@gmail.com  Sat Sep 12 06:16:27 2015  Sat Sep 12 06:16:27 2015
From: onemda@gmail.com (Paul B Mahol) (Paul B Mahol)
Date: Sat, 12 Sep 2015 04:16:27 +0000
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter: add stereowiden filter
Message-ID: <1442031387-18410-1-git-send-email-onemda@gmail.com>

Signed-off-by: Paul B Mahol <onemda at gmail.com>
---
