Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2015 12:00:20 +0200
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avcodec/dvenc: silence
 -Wdiscarded-qualifiers
In-Reply-To: <1442704081-29372-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>
