From k@ylo.ph  Tue Sep 22 19:58:45 2015  Tue Sep 22 19:58:45 2015
From: k@ylo.ph (Kyle Swanson) (Kyle Swanson)
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2015 12:58:45 -0500
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter/af_tremolo: fix envelope phase
Message-ID: <1442944725-15753-1-git-send-email-k@ylo.ph>

Signed-off-by: Kyle Swanson <k at ylo.ph>
---
 libavfilter/af_tremolo.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libavfilter/af_tremolo.c b/libavfilter/af_tremolo.c
index 6335401..69eaa34 100644
--- a/libavfilter/af_tremolo.c
+++ b/libavfilter/af_tremolo.c
