Hi,

On Fri, Sep 25, 2015 at 5:09 PM, Christophe Gisquet <
christophe.gisquet at gmail.com> wrote:

> Hi,
>
> 2015-09-25 22:36 GMT+02:00 Ronald S. Bultje <rsbultje at gmail.com>:
> > +pd_16: times 8 dd 16
>
> In h264_intrapred_10bit.asm
>
