From tfoucu@gmail.com  Mon Sep 28 23:34:45 2015  Mon Sep 28 23:34:45 2015
From: tfoucu@gmail.com (Thierry Foucu) (Thierry Foucu)
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2015 14:34:45 -0700
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] libavformat/flvdec.c: free always the packet
	after a resync.
Message-ID: <1443476085-13384-1-git-send-email-tfoucu@gmail.com>

In case of resync, always free the packet, but retry only if the resync
did not get to the end of the file. Otherwise, there is a memory leak when the
last packet in the file is corrupted.
---
 libavformat/flvdec.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/libavformat/flvdec.c b/libavformat/flvdec.c
index 16d25e9..a59c07d 100644
--- a/libavformat/flvdec.c
+++ b/libavformat/flvdec.c
@@ -1142,8 +1142,8 @@ leave:
         av_log(s, AV_LOG_ERROR, "Packet mismatch %d %d\n", last, orig_size + 11);
         avio_seek(s->pb, pos + 1, SEEK_SET);
         ret = resync(s);
+        av_free_packet(pkt);
         if (ret >= 0) {
-            av_free_packet(pkt);
             goto retry;
         }
     }
-- 
