From: onemda@gmail.com (Paul B Mahol) (Paul B Mahol)
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2015 10:49:37 +0200
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter: add zscale filter
Message-ID: <1443602977-25050-1-git-send-email-onemda@gmail.com>

Signed-off-by: Paul B Mahol <onemda at gmail.com>
---
 configure                |   4 +
