From henrik@gramner.com  Thu Oct  1 21:10:19 2015  Thu Oct  1 21:10:19 2015
From: henrik@gramner.com (Henrik Gramner) (Henrik Gramner)
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2015 21:10:19 +0200
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter/vf_maskedmerge: add SIMD for
 maskedmerge with 8 bit depth input
In-Reply-To: <1443724932-19679-1-git-send-email-onemda@gmail.com>
