From onemda@gmail.com  Fri Oct  2 13:42:51 2015  Fri Oct  2 13:42:51 2015
From: onemda@gmail.com (Paul B Mahol) (Paul B Mahol)
Date: Fri,  2 Oct 2015 13:42:51 +0200
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter: add zscale filter
Message-ID: <1443786171-24432-1-git-send-email-onemda@gmail.com>

Signed-off-by: Paul B Mahol <onemda at gmail.com>
---
 configure                |   4 +
