From gajjanagadde@gmail.com  Sun Oct  4 18:04:41 2015  Sun Oct  4 18:04:41 2015
From: gajjanagadde@gmail.com (Ganesh Ajjanagadde) (Ganesh Ajjanagadde)
Date: Sun,  4 Oct 2015 12:04:41 -0400
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] ffplay: more robust mutex creation
Message-ID: <1443974681-28873-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>

SDL_CreateMutex can fail:
https://wiki.libsdl.org/SDL_CreateMutex.
This patch makes creation more robust in one instance.

Signed-off-by: Ganesh Ajjanagadde <gajjanagadde at gmail.com>
---
 ffplay.c | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ffplay.c b/ffplay.c
index da0fd3a..eaf26be 100644
--- a/ffplay.c
+++ b/ffplay.c
@@ -2817,6 +2817,12 @@ static int read_thread(void *arg)
     int scan_all_pmts_set = 0;
     int64_t pkt_ts;
 
+    if (!wait_mutex) {
+        av_log(NULL, AV_LOG_FATAL, "SDL_CreateMutex(): %s\n", SDL_GetError());
+        ret = AVERROR(ENOMEM);
+        goto fail;
+    }
+
     memset(st_index, -1, sizeof(st_index));
     is->last_video_stream = is->video_stream = -1;
     is->last_audio_stream = is->audio_stream = -1;
-- 
2.6.0


