From ivan.uskov@nablet.com  Thu Oct  8 17:34:39 2015  Thu Oct  8 17:34:39 2015
From: ivan.uskov@nablet.com (Ivan Uskov) (Ivan Uskov)
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2015 18:34:39 +0300
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] configure: disabling --enable-libmfx and
	--enable-gpl combination
Message-ID: <1134106908.20151008183439@nablet.com>

Hello All,

Since libmfx is not under GPL, Intel asked to correct "configure" behavior
for --enable-libmfx option to avoid licenses violation:
./configure --enable-libmfx
- allowed

./configure --enable-libmfx --enable-gpl
-prohibited, error message

./configure --enable-libmfx --enable-gpl --enable-nonfree
-allowed

Please review.

-- 
Best regards,
 Ivan                          mailto:ivan.uskov at nablet.com
