> >> use a compiled version based on the De-Bruijn method of Leiserson et al:
> >> http://supertech.csail.mit.edu/papers/debruijn.pdf.
> >>
> >> Tested with FATE, sample benchmark (x86-64, GCC 5.2.0, Haswell)
