From michaelni@gmx.at  Sun Oct 11 21:16:27 2015  Sun Oct 11 21:16:27 2015
From: michaelni@gmx.at (Michael Niedermayer) (Michael Niedermayer)
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2015 21:16:27 +0200
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 2/2] avcodec/h264_slice: Never call
	get_format() for just checking if the format matches
In-Reply-To: <1444590987-17080-1-git-send-email-michaelni@gmx.at>
