From rodger.combs@gmail.com  Mon Oct 12 07:38:50 2015  Mon Oct 12 07:38:50 2015
From: rodger.combs@gmail.com (Rodger Combs) (Rodger Combs)
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2015 00:38:50 -0500
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 2/7] lavu/aes: move AVAES to separate
	internal header
In-Reply-To: <1444628335-5546-1-git-send-email-rodger.combs@gmail.com>
