From: Vincent.Riera@imgtec.com (Vicente Olivert Riera) (Vicente Olivert Riera)
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2015 14:58:49 +0100
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] mips: disable all features in configure if
