From christophe.gisquet@gmail.com  Wed Oct 14 19:20:49 2015  Wed Oct 14 19:20:49 2015
From: christophe.gisquet@gmail.com (Christophe Gisquet) (Christophe Gisquet)
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2015 19:20:49 +0200
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] dnxhd: interleave AC levels and flags
Message-ID: <1444843249-4032-1-git-send-email-christophe.gisquet@gmail.com>

This allows more efficient access to the array as the level and flags
are contiguous. Around 4% faster coefficient decoding.
---
Not the cleanest, and may complicate adding new profiles. But DNxHR
just got added, so it should be ok for some years.
---
