From: cus@passwd.hu (Marton Balint) (Marton Balint)
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2015 01:10:50 +0200 (CEST)
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] Stream specifier enhancement
In-Reply-To: <561F68BF.9000805@vivanet.hu>
References: <561C19DA.1070003@vivanet.hu>
 <alpine.LNX.2.00.1510122300200.27903@iq.passwd.hu>
