Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCHv2] avutil/mathematics: speed up av_gcd by
 using Stein's binary GCD algorithm
In-Reply-To: <20151011034505.GJ4540@nb4>
References: <1444528727-10567-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>
 <20151011034505.GJ4540@nb4>
