Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avformat/mp3dec: improve junk skipping
 heuristic
In-Reply-To: <20151020001200.GE4540@nb4>
References: <20151017143310.GZ4540@nb4>
 <1445289123-30573-1-git-send-email-nfxjfg@googlemail.com>
