From mfcc64@gmail.com  Fri Oct 23 20:31:30 2015  Fri Oct 23 20:31:30 2015
From: mfcc64@gmail.com (Muhammad Faiz) (Muhammad Faiz)
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2015 01:31:30 +0700
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter/avf_showcqt: rewrite showcqt and
	add features
