> the enum array, etc and likely greater scope for mistakes as a result.


Small vs. big diff is a "preference" in FFmpeg, that is, we "prefer"
smaller diffs over bigger diffs, everything all being equal. However, not
everything else is equal in this case. Plus, the diff is not that big.

Ronald

