From slomo@coaxion.net  Sun Nov  1 21:20:19 2015  Sun Nov  1 21:20:19 2015
From: slomo@coaxion.net (=?UTF-8?q?Sebastian=20Dr=C3=B6ge?=) (=?UTF-8?q?Sebastian=20Dr=C3=B6ge?=)
Date: Sun,  1 Nov 2015 22:20:19 +0200
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 1/2] mpegtsenc: Add support for muxing Opus
	in MPEG-TS
In-Reply-To: <1446409220-8552-1-git-send-email-slomo@coaxion.net>
