> saturate
> + * correctly (usually converted to a cvttsd2si on x86) which saturates
> numbers
> + * > INT64_MAX to INT64_MIN. The standard marks such conversions as
> undefined
> + * behavior, allowing this sort of mathematically bogus conversions. This
> provides
