Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH][RFC] avcodec/aacsbr_template: replace
	qsort with AV_QSORT
In-Reply-To: <1445996290-10514-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>
References: <1445996290-10514-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>
