From gajjanag@mit.edu  Wed Nov  4 14:17:12 2015  Wed Nov  4 14:17:12 2015
From: gajjanag@mit.edu (Ganesh Ajjanagadde) (Ganesh Ajjanagadde)
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2015 08:17:12 -0500
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH][RFC] avcodec/aacsbr_template: replace
 qsort with AV_QSORT
In-Reply-To: <CAE9qxYA0zs3M7j0ahubkKj3EH54i4DBbPK3FWnY+=UFU8fw-OQ@mail.gmail.com>
References: <1445996290-10514-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>
 <CAE9qxYACdHp12+wZ705q8fxW3AMtHhPaUgqKYpG8+ooyKiJSuQ@mail.gmail.com>
 <CAC=fB=aCwePCSRK30sRvtAyXH_5GN4sASkbgPB4+bj5dj5W8zQ@mail.gmail.com>
 <CAE9qxYA0zs3M7j0ahubkKj3EH54i4DBbPK3FWnY+=UFU8fw-OQ@mail.gmail.com>
