Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] avfilter: add anoisesrc
Message-ID: <1446661197-18583-1-git-send-email-k@ylo.ph>

Signed-off-by: Kyle Swanson <k at ylo.ph>
---
 Changelog                    |   1 +
 doc/filters.texi             |  36 +++++++
 libavfilter/Makefile         |   1 +
 libavfilter/allfilters.c     |   1 +
 libavfilter/asrc_anoisesrc.c | 222 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
