From nfxjfg@googlemail.com  Fri Nov  6 16:15:30 2015  Fri Nov  6 16:15:30 2015
From: nfxjfg@googlemail.com (wm4) (wm4)
Date: Fri,  6 Nov 2015 16:15:30 +0100
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 2/2] mmaldec: correct package buffering
	accounting
In-Reply-To: <1446822930-28229-1-git-send-email-nfxjfg@googlemail.com>
References: <1446822930-28229-1-git-send-email-nfxjfg@googlemail.com>
Message-ID: <1446822930-28229-2-git-send-email-nfxjfg@googlemail.com>

The assert in ffmmal_stop_decoder() could trigger sometimes. The
packets_buffered counter was indeed not correctly maintained, and
packets were not subtracted from it if they were still in the waiting
queue.

---
 libavcodec/mmaldec.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libavcodec/mmaldec.c b/libavcodec/mmaldec.c
