From gajjanagadde@gmail.com  Wed Nov 11 04:35:23 2015  Wed Nov 11 04:35:23 2015
From: gajjanagadde@gmail.com (Ganesh Ajjanagadde) (Ganesh Ajjanagadde)
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2015 22:35:23 -0500
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH] all: use predefined mathematics macros
Message-ID: <1447212923-19044-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>

This uses M_SQRT2, M_PI, and M_E instead of the actual literals.
Benefits include:
1. Reduced scope for copy/paste errors and improved readability.
2. Consistency across the codebase.
3. Actually fixes an incorrect sqrt(2) in avcodec/ppc.
4. Greater precision in avcodec/ac3.

Patch tested with FATE on x86, ppc untested.

Signed-off-by: Ganesh Ajjanagadde <gajjanagadde at gmail.com>
