From Vincent.Riera@imgtec.com  Mon Nov 16 15:57:10 2015  Mon Nov 16 15:57:10 2015
From: Vincent.Riera@imgtec.com (Vicente Olivert Riera) (Vicente Olivert Riera)
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2015 14:57:10 +0000
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 04/13] Remove --mips64r6 configure option
In-Reply-To: <1447685839-58350-1-git-send-email-Vincent.Riera@imgtec.com>
