From Vincent.Riera@imgtec.com  Mon Nov 16 15:57:16 2015  Mon Nov 16 15:57:16 2015
From: Vincent.Riera@imgtec.com (Vicente Olivert Riera) (Vicente Olivert Riera)
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2015 14:57:16 +0000
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 10/13] Put "disable mipsfpu" in a better
