From michaelni@gmx.at  Fri Nov 20 03:26:20 2015  Fri Nov 20 03:26:20 2015
From: michaelni@gmx.at (Michael Niedermayer) (Michael Niedermayer)
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2015 03:26:20 +0100
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 2/3] ffserver: Use AVOption API to access ffm
	demuxer instead of direct access depending on ABI
In-Reply-To: <1447986381-6352-1-git-send-email-michaelni@gmx.at>
