> Subject: [PATCH] avfilter: add compensation delay line filter
>
> Signed-off-by: Paul B Mahol <onemda at gmail.com>
> ---
>  doc/filters.texi                   |  42 ++++++++
>  libavfilter/Makefile               |   1 +
