From george@nsup.org  Thu Nov 26 19:47:53 2015  Thu Nov 26 19:47:53 2015
From: george@nsup.org (Nicolas George) (Nicolas George)
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2015 19:47:53 +0100
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 2/3] lavf/utils: handle AVERROR_REDO.
In-Reply-To: <1448563674-29835-1-git-send-email-george@nsup.org>
