Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCHv2] avcodec/aac_tablegen: get rid of hardcoded
	tables entirely
Message-ID: <1448670920-24487-1-git-send-email-gajjanagadde@gmail.com>

Commit 96786a12f6df26990bbe7c0ca4592b3731724469 makes runtime
initialization cheap.

Tested with FATE, with/without --enable-hardcoded-tables.

Reviewed-by: Rostislav Pehlivanov <atomnuker at gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Ganesh Ajjanagadde <gajjanagadde at gmail.com>
---
 libavcodec/Makefile            |  7 ++--
