From george@nsup.org  Sun Nov 29 17:21:50 2015  Sun Nov 29 17:21:50 2015
From: george@nsup.org (Nicolas George) (Nicolas George)
Date: Sun, 29 Nov 2015 17:21:50 +0100
Subject: [FFmpeg-devel] [PATCH 3/5] lavfi: deprecate
	avfilter_link_set_closed().
In-Reply-To: <1448814112-20306-1-git-send-email-george@nsup.org>
References: <1448814112-20306-1-git-send-email-george@nsup.org>
Message-ID: <1448814112-20306-3-git-send-email-george@nsup.org>

Applications are not supposed to mess with links,
they should close the sinks.
